an write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{100{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{50}{|10x|\\sqrt{(10x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =50\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{10}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =50\\cdot \\frac{1}{10}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =5\\,\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =5\\,\\text{arcsec}(10x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186332729 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "26bff1d2-1a1f-5568-b606-c926ad4e222e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330288} {:answer/id #uuid "38f382b6-b9e0-5d37-bb15-bf2017958200" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(4x)}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330460} {:answer/id #uuid "88b1a168-dccc-5c24-aa5c-58eef11e4b53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\text{arcsec}(4x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186331165} {:answer/id #uuid "8a671a08-acf6-51a4-a4b1-a79a1a8a1a19" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(16x)}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186331179} {:answer/id #uuid "c1c62bda-b0cb-5477-843f-9e7f08c270e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(4x)}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186331672}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1c62bda-b0cb-5477-843f-9e7f08c270e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(4x)}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186331672} :answer-field/id #uuid "2ed515ce-b125-59ef-ba87-1982f7680cc3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186332279}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "cd302e3c-b39d-509b-8801-010e64d93a57" :question/math-academy-id "q-49519" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{4|x|\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{4|x|\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-1}}=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|4x|\\sqrt{(4x)^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $4x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=4x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{4|x|\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{|4x|\\sqrt{(4x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(4x)}{4}+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186332740 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b0edf81-9914-5a0f-b9b6-d58d70540093" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(x)}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330630} {:answer/id #uuid "70cf07b2-a48c-5c20-b1ad-493648041c3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(9x)}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186330962} {:answer/id #uuid "9a56a3d4-f0db-5dee-8e1b-e1e7174dd979" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3x)}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186331338} {:answer/id #uuid "a43c7a93-7056-56e0-adc4-8cc368c5eac5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186331423} {:answer/id #uuid "e8c453d1-3b22-5ee0-8261-9dc453f931aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :a